            <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><hi rend="font-size large(2)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=large;level=2" source="#source-339476-339572"><seg source="#source-339476-339503">斎藤寿八氏自室気付</seg></hi></p>
            <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><hi rend="font-size large(5)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=large;level=5" source="#source-339582-339660"><seg source="#source-339582-339600">面黒楼万児宛</seg></hi></p>
